  "html": "<p>🌙 Start strong with the Lunar X.</p>\n<p>Designed for beginners and improving players, the Lunar X offers the perfect blend of forgiveness, control, and easy power to help you build confidence on court. Whether you’re learning dinks, working on consistency, or starting to play more competitive games, the Lunar X is built to make the game feel more comfortable and enjoyable from day one.</p>\n<p>Featuring a forgiving sweet spot and stable construction, the Lunar X helps reduce mishits while giving players enough pop for drives and putaways — without feeling difficult to control. A great paddle for players looking to improve their skills with confidence and enjoy every step of their pickleball journey. 🏓✨</p>\n<p><strong>Product Specifications:</strong><br>• <strong>Surface:</strong> Toray T-700 Raw Carbon Fiber<br>• <strong>Construction:</strong> Thermoformed with Edge Foam Technology<br>• <strong>Core:</strong> Polymer Honeycomb Core<br>• <strong>Sweet Spot:</strong> Forgiving sweet spot for greater consistency<br>• <strong>Play Style:</strong> Beginner-friendly balance of control and easy power<br>• <strong>Spin Potential:</strong> Textured raw carbon surface for improved spin generation</p>\n<p>Perfect for beginners looking for a paddle that is easy to use, confidence-inspiring, and built to grow with your game. 🌙</p>"
